I show Nina around.
We start in the living room.
It is bright and nice here.
In the living room there is a big, soft sofa.
A small table stands in the middle of the room.
By the window stands an old lamp.
I think it is beautiful.
I walk over to the sofa.
And I sit down for a moment.
The sofa is very comfortable.
I look at Nina.
She smiles at me.
"I like it here," I say.
It is a nice place.
